WEBVTT

00:08:31.085 --> 00:08:33.520
da nasilje nije automatski prisutno 
u nečijoj vjeri ili rasi,

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:36.433
i da sin ne mora slijediti

00:08:36.433 --> 00:08:39.515
put svojeg oca.

00:08:39.515 --> 00:08:42.305
Ja nisam moj otac.

00:08:42.305 --> 00:08:45.205
Hvala. (Pljesak)

00:08:45.205 --> 00:08:48.864
Hvala vam, ljudi. (Pljesak)

00:08:48.864 --> 00:08:51.504
Hvala vam svima. (Pljesak)

00:08:51.504 --> 00:08:55.504
Puno hvala. (Pljesak)